[00:01.51]Sometimes I can't help but feel like I don't belong here
{"有时我不禁觉得自己不属于这里"}
[00:09.10]Out of place, out of mind, like [?]
{"格格不入 恍若隔世 就像[?]"}
[00:13.72]There's nothing else that feels like is meant for me
{"没有什么事物让我感觉是为我而存在"}
[00:19.17]But I've got a sweet escape
{"但我找到了甜蜜的逃避"}
[00:22.81]Under bright lights
{"在璀璨灯光下"}
